  "description": "The Uwell Caliburn G5 Lite SE offers the exceptional performance of the G5 Lite series but housed in a chassis designed for those who prefer a more classic, sophisticated aesthetic. While the standard Lite features an eye-catching translucent shell, the SE edition sports a premium textured finish, providing a solid, tactile grip and a sophisticated look that stands out in the pod system market. Internally, the device is a powerhouse. It retains the class-leading 1600mAh internal battery, ensuring endurance that significantly outlasts standard pod kits. Capable of delivering up to 35W of power, the G5 Lite SE utilises Uwell's Smart Output technology to automatically detect the installed coil resistance and adjust the wattage for optimal performance. The kit is fully compatible with the new GPP Integrated Coil Cartridges and the existing Caliburn G3 pod platform. It features the latest PRO-FOCS 4.0 Flavour Technology, which enhances the complexity of e-liquids and extends coil longevity. With a 360° Clear View juice window and the intuitive 4-Bar Gradient LED battery indicator, the G5 Lite SE merges style, stamina, and simplicity into one refined package. Please Note: This kit does not come with a USB-C charging cable. We Recommend using the following E-Liquid with these pods: 0.6ohm - Use Nic salt or 50/50 (freebase) E-Liquids Please Note: When filling your pod with vape liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
